  Description: Since hatching in the vicinity of a powerful source of magic, a trace
    of it flows through your veins. Choose one common cantrip from the arcane spell
    list. You can Cast this Spell as an arcane innate spell at will. A cantrip is
    heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up. You are trained
    in the spell attack modifier and spell DC statistics, and your key spellcasting
    ability is Charisma.
